{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_77_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_77","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_77_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_77","textTraditional":"十有四年春，諸侯城緣陵。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_77_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_77","textTraditional":"夏六月，季姬及鄫子遇于防。使鄫子來朝。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_77_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_77","textTraditional":"秋八月辛卯，沙鹿崩。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_77_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_77","textTraditional":"狄侵鄭。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_77_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_77","textTraditional":"冬，蔡侯肸卒。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_77_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_77","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_77_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_77","textTraditional":"十四年春，諸侯城緣陵而遷杞焉。不書其人，有闕也。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_77_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_77","textTraditional":"鄫季姬來寧，公怒，止之，以鄫子之不朝也。夏，遇於防，而使來朝。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_77_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_77","textTraditional":"秋八月辛卯，沙鹿崩。晉卜偃曰：「期年將有大咎，幾亡國。」","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_77_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_77","textTraditional":"冬，秦饑，使乞糴于晉，晉人弗與。慶鄭曰：「背施，無親；幸災，不仁；貪愛，不祥；怒鄰，不義。四德皆失，何以守國？」虢射曰：「皮之不存，毛將安傅？」慶鄭曰：「棄信背鄰，患孰卹之？無信，患作；失授，必斃。是則然矣！」虢射曰：「無損於怨而厚於寇，不如勿與。」慶鄭曰：「背施幸災，民所棄也。近猶讎之，況怨敵乎？」弗聽。退曰：「君其悔是哉！」","sentenceOrder":11}],"overrides":{}}